{"id":"b1f32514-1cd7-441e-972a-53eb0c749cfa","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"852daa268b309dc9","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/git-panel.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"66a7b1b410dfb7c7ab583e6a9b1d0bd274e277de","start":2046,"end":2161},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","DiffOverlay","{","\"","el","\"",":","HTMLElement",";","\"","title","\"",":","HTMLElement",";","\"","body","\"",":","HTMLElement",";","\"","close","\"",":","HTMLElement","}"]},"context":{"before":"b19acddb629e72a5","after":"79ff53e0088bc105"}},"payload":{"text":"The diff dialog — a shell-owned overlay that covers the editor when a file is opened. The shell hands us its four\nelements; we drive them imperatively (codehike mounts a React root into `body`, so it stays outside preact).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:50:21.790Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:50:21.790Z"}
{"id":"bf5c4fd2-3bcd-42eb-b180-43d05f3f3913","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7e6227bd52df3347#4","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/git-panel.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"16baacf57d68abd0ecfc32f992e9cb009788a09b","start":17779,"end":17788},"shape":{"type":"Identifier","atoms":["useEffect"]},"context":{"before":"48f35df9457e0d66","after":"8734b173b97592e3"}},"payload":{"text":"Follow the OS light/dark scheme: re-highlight the open diff with the matching shiki theme when it flips. The\ndocKey (path) is unchanged, so the diff's fold/selection state survives the re-mount.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:43.592Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:43.592Z"}
{"id":"d03a1713-4f9e-41bf-abb3-648cbe6f8de3","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3d7dd0698ad4651f","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/git-panel.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"0d04552fde726369dff2c2ffd447829bef346fae","start":12110,"end":12453},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","fileState","=","(","path",":","string",")",":","FileState","[","\"","state","\"","]","=>","{","if","(","deselected",".","has","(","path",")",")","{","return","\"","off","\"",";","}","const","dropped","=","lineDeselect",".","get","(","path",")",";","const","total","=","changedCount",".","get","(","path",")",";","if","(","dropped","!==","undefined","&&","dropped",".","size",">","0",")","{","return","total","!==","undefined","&&","dropped",".","size",">=","total","?","\"","off","\"",":","\"","partial","\"",";","}","return","\"","all","\"",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"744ef4646fdd90b9","after":"8e1111c10f6e981a"}},"payload":{"text":"A file is fully in (\"all\"), fully out (\"off\"), or has a per-line partial selection (\"partial\"). A partial\nselection covering every changed row reads as \"off\".","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:48:40.177Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:48:40.177Z"}
